From ba2e41be0ee5252037bf49f8f772f679e8716628 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 15:24:52 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] ADD Vim-style visual selection across terminal panes for
 predictable yanks

Treat v, V, and Ctrl-V as immediate visual selection modes in whichever pane has focus, and derive the left-pane anchor from the rendered row so copied text matches what the user selected. The harness covers character, line, and block selection in both panes.
---
 src/ui.rs            |  28 +++++-------
 tests/terminal_ui.rs |  27 +++++++----
 tests/ui_harness.rs  | 106 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 3 files changed, 132 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/ui.rs b/src/ui.rs
